# Ignore build folders in all subprojects
**/Debug/
**/Release/
**/x64/
**/ipch/

# Ignore Visual Studio folders
**/.vs/

# Ignore Visual Studio user-specific and temp files
**/*.suo
**/*.user
**/*.VC.db
**/*.VC.opendb
**/*.log
**/*.obj
**/*.pch
**/*.pdb
**/*.idb
**/*.ilk
**/*.tlog
**/*.cache
**/*.tmp

# Ignore binaries
**/*.exe
**/*.dll

# Optional: Ignore backup or generated files
**/*.bak
**/*.class
